        "answer": {
          "short": "$x\\geq3$ or $x\\leq3$.",
          "worked": "$$y=(x-3)^2-1$$\nThe turning point is $(3,-1)$. The two restrictions are $x\\geq3$ or $x\\leq3$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
